# Prompt Template for GPT-4o Evaluation

Multi-persona argument quality assessment framework assesses the quality of an argument from multiple perspectives. It first generates $\{N\}$ personas and corresponding perspectives for assessing quality of input argument, then analyzes its argumentative strengths and weaknesses (i.e., analytical rationales) from each of the $\{N\}$ personas and perspectives. Now, there are personas/perspectives and corresponding analytical rationales generated from two different models (i.e., Model 1 and Model 2), please evaluate which model generates better personas and which model generates better rationales separately. 0 indicates Model 1 is better than Model 2, 1 indicates Model 2 is better than Model 1, 2 indicates Model 1 and Model 2 are equally good.

```markdown
## Target Argument:
[Topic]: {t}
[Target Argument]: {a}
## Model 1:
[Persona 1]: {p^d_1}
[Perspectives 1]: {p^p_1}
[Rationale 1]: [Strengths]: {r^s_1} | [Weaknesses]: {r^w_1}
...
## Model 2:
[Persona 1]: {p^d_1}
[Perspectives 1]: {p^p_1}
[Rationale 1]: [Strengths]: {r^s_1} | [Weaknesses]: {r^w_1}
...
## Answer:
Give your answer in json format like this: {"the_model Generatingbetter_rationales} 
```

